note={}
}'}, 'assigned_action_editor': {'value': '~Caglar_Gulcehre1'}, 'code': {'value': 'https://github.com/baturaysaglam/AC-Off-POC'}, 'license': {'value': 'Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)'}, 'paperhash': {'value': 'saglam|mitigating_offpolicy_bias_in_actorcritic_methods_with_onestep_qlearning_a_novel_correction_approach'}}

{'title': {'value': 'Image Reconstruction via Deep Image Prior Subspaces'}, 'abstract': {'value': "Deep learning has been widely used for solving image reconstruction tasks but its deployability has been held back due to the shortage of high-quality paired training data. Unsupervised learning methods, e.g., deep image prior (DIP), naturally fill this gap, but bring a host of new issues: the susceptibility to overfitting due to a lack of robust early stopping strategies and unstable convergence.
We present a novel approach to tackle these issues by restricting DIP optimisation to a sparse linear subspace of its parameters, employing a synergy of dimensionality reduction techniques and second order optimisation methods. The low-dimensionality of the subspace reduces DIP's tendency to fit noise and allows the use of stable second order optimisation methods, e.g., natural gradient descent or L-BFGS.
Experiments across both image restoration and tomographic tasks of different geometry and ill-posedness show that second order optimisation within a low-dimensional subspace is favourable in terms of optimisation stability to reconstruction fidelity trade-off."}, 'authors': {'value': ['Riccardo Barbano', 'Javier Antoran', 'Johannes Leuschner', 'José Miguel Hernández-Lobato', 'Bangti Jin', 'Zeljko Kereta']}, 'authorids': {'value': ['~Riccardo_Barbano1', '~Javier_Antoran1', '~Johannes_Leuschner1', '~Jose_Miguel_Hernandez_Lobato1', '~Bangti_Jin1', '~Zeljko_Kereta1']}, 'pdf': {'value': '/pdf/adc588cb55e59c8568ac596c43c0f4c8bd51eb2c.pdf'}, 'submission_length': {'value': 'Regular submission (no more than 12 pages of main content)'}, 'supplementary_material': {'value': '/attachment/c651ea13844dff0689b0f6c794132bde8db18489.pdf'}, 'venue': {'value': 'Accepted by TMLR'}, 'venueid': {'value': 'TMLR'}, '_bibtex': {'value': "@article{
barbano2024image,
title={Image Reconstruction via Deep Image Prior Subspaces},
