For final camera ready version. Table has been adjusted to ensure it fits within page margins. Code link has been added to abstract. Font size in figure 1 increased from 10pt to 12pt.'}, 'venue': {'value': 'Accepted by TMLR'}, 'venueid': {'value': 'TMLR'}, '_bibtex': {'value': '@article{
everett2023protocaps,
