{'title': {'value': 'Wrapped $\beta$-Gaussians with compact support for exact probabilistic modeling on manifolds'}, 'abstract': {'value': 'We introduce wrapped $\beta$-Gaussians, a family of wrapped distributions on Riemannian manifolds, supporting efficient reparametrized sampling, as well as exact density estimation, effortlessly supporting high dimensions and anisotropic scale parameters. We extend Fenchel-Young losses for geometry-aware learning with wrapped $\beta$-Gaussians, and demonstrate the efficacy of our proposed family in a suite of experiments on hypersphere and rotation manifolds: data fitting, hierarchy encoding, generative modeling with variational autoencoders, and multilingual word embedding alignment.'}, 'authors': {'value': ['Sergey Troshin', 'Vlad Niculae']}, 'authorids': {'value': ['~Sergey_Troshin1', '~Vlad_Niculae2']}, 'pdf': {'value': '/pdf/bfd83be3d4968e3161796f793c01e15a6a4f85c9.pdf'}, 'submission_length': {'value': 'Regular submission (no more than 12 pages of main content)'}, 'supplementary_material': {'value': '/attachment/dcaff0e1426dcc81b0f9e7b2a081c81aab02c98f.zip'}, 'venue': {'value': 'Accepted by TMLR'}, 'venueid': {'value': 'TMLR'}, 'changes_since_last_submission': {'value': 'Final version:
- add acknowledgments
